            <p><strong>University:</strong> Invertis University</p>
            <p><strong>Student Code:</strong> bcai2026079</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="about" class="page">
        <h2>About Me</h2>
        <p>My name is Prabhat Pal. I am pursuing BCA in Artificial Intelligence from Invertis University.</p>

        <div class="card">
